    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463460/extras/fd9bb4703b9fe42d4653f8f1090b4430.poster.avif?t=1739447767\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463460/extras/fd9bb4703b9fe42d4653f8f1090b4430.webm?t=1739447767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463460/extras/fd9bb4703b9fe42d4653f8f1090b4430.mp4?t=1739447767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hidden Tomatoes 3</i> takes you on a relaxing hidden object adventure through enchanting forests, tranquil rivers, and charming old rural houses. Your task is to find 100 hidden tomatoes cleverly concealed in this serene and captivating environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With soothing background music and stunning visuals, this game offers a peaceful yet engaging experience for players of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf45 1 Level, 100 hidden tomatoes in a lush forest and riverside setting.<br>\ud83d\udc49 Click on the tomatoes as you spot them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful forests, sparkling rivers, and rustic rural homes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure\u2014enjoy the calm and take your time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect mix of relaxation and challenge for hidden object enthusiasts.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463460/extras/fd9bb4703b9fe42d4653f8f1090b4430.poster.avif?t=1739447767\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463460/extras/fd9bb4703b9fe42d4653f8f1090b4430.webm?t=1739447767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463460/extras/fd9bb4703b9fe42d4653f8f1090b4430.mp4?t=1739447767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hidden Tomatoes 3</i> takes you on a relaxing hidden object adventure through enchanting forests, tranquil rivers, and charming old rural houses. Your task is to find 100 hidden tomatoes cleverly concealed in this serene and captivating environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With soothing background music and stunning visuals, this game offers a peaceful yet engaging experience for players of all ages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf45 1 Level, 100 hidden tomatoes in a lush forest and riverside setting.<br>\ud83d\udc49 Click on the tomatoes as you spot them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful forests, sparkling rivers, and rustic rural homes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time pressure\u2014enjoy the calm and take your time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect mix of relaxation and challenge for hidden object enthusiasts.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore serene forests, sparkling river, and rustic rural houses in *Hidden Tomatoes 3*! Find 100 cleverly hidden tomatoes in a peaceful yet challenging hidden object adventure. With stunning visuals and relaxing gameplay, it's fun for all ages. Can you uncover them all?",
